-- konsol#159 / konsolidat#175 review rounds 2 and 3: decisions 12-14 on data.
-- Generated from what konsol writes for this dataset on konsolidat.local
-- (Entity, Consolidation Group, Ownership Period, Historical Equity Rate,
-- Intercompany Account, and 19 Trial Balance Submissions), FY2095, ZZ codes
-- only, except the governed EUR->USD rates, which are written by hand (see below).
--   Group ZZGRP (USD), intercompany-difference account ZZ2100, tolerance 5.
--   Flags ZZ1100 <-> ZZ2010 (balance sheet) and ZZ4030 <-> ZZ5030 (P&L).
--   ZZA 100% USD, ZZB 80% USD, ZZC 100% USD, ZZD 100% EUR, ZZ7 70% USD from 2095-01-01;
--   ZZE 100% USD from 2095-03-01 (acquired in P3); ZZH 100% USD to 2095-02-28 (disposed);
--   ZZQ 100% full to 2095-02-28, then 40% equity;
--   sub-group ZZSUB, owned 100% by ZZGRP to 2095-02-28 (sold), holding ZZS 100% (open).
--   P1  ZZA ZZ1100 +1000 (ZZB) / ZZB ZZ2010 -1000       12: an 80%-owned side
--       ZZA ZZ1100 +500 (ZZC) / ZZC ZZ2010 -500 in P2   14: a balance-sheet timing pair
--       ZZA ZZ1100 +200 (ZZE) / ZZE ZZ2010 -200         before ZZE joins
--       ZZA ZZ1100 +400 (ZZH) / ZZH ZZ2010 -400         reversed after ZZH leaves
--       ZZA ZZ1100 +300 (ZZS) / ZZS ZZ2010 -300         M1: reversed after ZZSUB is sold
--       ZZA ZZ1100 +150 (ZZQ) / ZZQ ZZ2010 -150         M1: reversed after ZZQ moves to equity
--       ZZ7 ZZ1100 +600 (ZZB) / ZZB ZZ2010 -600         L2: 70% against 80%
--       ZZ7 ZZ4030 -200 (ZZB) / ZZB ZZ5030 +200         L1, L2: the same on a P&L pair
--       ZZA ZZ4030 -300 (ZZB) / ZZB ZZ5030 +312         13: booking difference
--       ZZA ZZ4030 -1000 (ZZD) / ZZD ZZ5030 +925 EUR    13: fx difference
--   P2  ZZA ZZ4030 -100 / ZZB ZZ5030 +100               14: P&L matched on the movement
--   P3  ZZA submits nothing                         M2: a quiet partner
--       ZZB ZZ2010 -50 (ZZA)                          L2: a booking difference on the 80% side
--   P4  ZZA ZZ1100 +50 (ZZB)                          matched again
--       ZZA ZZ1100 -200 (ZZE) / ZZE ZZ2010 +200         settled after the acquisition
-- Loaded and removed by tests/integration/test_dbt_build.py; the expected
-- entries are in tests/integration/ic_decisions_expectations.py.

-- epm_staging.main_accounts: 7 rows. konsolidat#227: this fixture used to name
-- accounts it never declared. '3010' was transcribed from the live chart on
-- konsolidat.local, where it is Additional paid-in capital; it exists in no chart
-- this repo loads, so the nine historical rates above it raised nine flags from
-- assert_historical_is_equity_only. The codes are ZZ-prefixed now, per
-- dbt_project/test_fixtures/README.md ("every entity, group and account code
-- starts with ZZ"), so no test datum carries a real customer account number.
-- Declared in ZZCOA under its 'ZZ' root, alongside the first-build fixture's own
-- accounts. is_retained_earnings stays 0 on all seven: ZZCOA already has exactly
-- one year-end close account (ZZ3100), and konsolidat#199 allows one per chart.
-- is_equity is account_type = 'Equity' (silver_main_accounts.sql:61), which is
-- what makes ZZ3010 a legal home for a historical rate.
